    star B.ζ ⬝ᵥ B.L.gram *ᵥ B.ζ = star (B.d.i₀ *ᵥ vecB B.o B.ζ) ⬝ᵥ B.V.gram *ᵥ (B.d.i₀ *ᵥ vecB B.o B.ζ) := by
